<title>GERMANY: Audi 10-month sales in Japan up 18.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Audi 10-month sales in Japan up 18.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>INGOLSTADT, Germany 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audi, the upmarket unit of carmaker Volkswagen AG, said its sales in the Japanese market jumped 18.9 percent in the first 10 months of 1996.</p>
<p>Audi said 8,018 vehicles had been sold in the region in the 10-month period compared with 6,743 a year earlier.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
